{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38162","headline":"寒食日沙县雨中看蔷薇 · 韩偓","name":"寒食日沙县雨中看蔷薇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处遇蔷薇，殊乡冷节时。\n雨声笼锦帐，风势偃罗帏。\n通体全无力，酡颜不自持。\n绿疎微露刺，红密欲藏枝。\n惬意凭阑久，贪吟放醆迟。\n旁人应见讶，自醉自题诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}